04:38.120 --> 04:42.920
And so we get better constraints between pulses which are actually far away and actually do

04:42.920 --> 04:45.400
not belong to the same place.

04:45.400 --> 04:49.640
Again that's something that doesn't vary often, does not happen very often but it can happen

04:49.640 --> 04:52.460
from time to time if places look similar.

04:52.460 --> 04:56.580
And the problem is that even a small number of those outliers and wrong loop closures

04:56.580 --> 05:00.420
