05:30.860 --> 05:35.540
And so the goal of today is that even if we have those outliers because our assumptions

05:35.540 --> 05:40.220
we don't have a perfect sensor here we cannot get rid of those outliers in general how can

05:40.220 --> 05:44.080
we perform the optimization that we're not sensitive to those outliers that even the

