So we take sum of Gaussian model but in the end we replace the sum by the max operator.

09:51.120 --> 09:55.800
That means if we have two modes which are rather far away the approximation error should

09:55.800 --> 10:00.000
be actually very small assuming the Gaussian have small variances because they're very

10:00.000 --> 10:06.040
